Run `pnpm run dev` at examples/test-app
And then run `cargo run` at examples/test-app-bin

Example endpoints:

POST "/emit":
Payload: JSON {
    "event_name": string,
    "payload": string
}
Response: JSON {
    "status": string
}


POST "/greet"
Payload: JSON {
    "name": string
}
Response: JSON {
    "message": string
}

POST "/set-state"
Payload: JSON {
    "state": string
}
Response: JSON {
    "old_state": string
}

WebSocket "/stream"
Payload: JSON {
    "upper_limit": i32
}
StreamEvent: JSON {
    "current": i32
}

WebSocket "/{event_name}"
StreamEvent: JSON {
    "payload": string
}